                "name": "project_manager_certification.pdf"
            },
            "courseProgram": "<p>The program introduces the architectural shift from legacy OSGi plugins to client extensions. Students will explore decoupled integration patterns, mapping out the local environment, and understanding the core schema specifications inside client-extension.yaml.</p><p>In the second part, we cover deployment, security, and orchestration. You will learn to deploy client extensions, set up OAuth2 user-agent authorization profiles, integrate custom headers and footers, and establish secure microservice communication.</p>",
            "duration": "4 weeks",
